## App shell — מבנה ומיקומים

### Outer frame (`app-root`)

- `body`: `--app-bg`, `min-height: 100vh`, flex center
- Desktop: padding `var(--space-4)` … `var(--space-8)` (sm→lg breakpoints)
- Mobile (`<768px`): padding 0, full viewport height

### Card shell (`.app-shell`)

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  max-width: 1440px │ height: 90vh (100vh mobile)             │
│  bg: card-bg │ backdrop-blur-xl │ radius: 32px (0 mobile)   │
│  border: card-border │ shadow: shadow-card                    │
│  display: flex │ overflow: hidden                             │
│  ┌────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
│  │Nav │              Content area                   │       │
│  │70px│         (variant per layout)                │       │
│  └────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- `.app-main`: `flex: 1`, `min-height: 0`, `overflow: hidden`

### Icon nav strip (`.app-nav-strip`) — מחליף nav-bar אופקי

**מיקום:** תמיד ב-`inline-start` של card shell (ימין ב-RTL, שמאל ב-LTR).

**מבנה אנכי (top → bottom):**

```
┌─────────┐
│  Logo   │  ← twin-shape brand + orange accent
├─────────┤
│         │
│  Icons  │  ← flex-col, gap 24px, centered
│  stack  │
│         │
├─────────┤
│ Logout? │
│ Avatar  │  ← 40px + status dot
└─────────┘
```

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Width | `var(--nav-strip-width)` — 70px |
| Background | `--panel-bg` |
| Border | `border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--border-light)` |
| Padding block | `var(--space-6)` |

**Nav button:** 40×40px, `--radius-md`, icon `--text-muted`.
**Hover:** brand color + `--main-bg` bg.
**Active:** `brand/10` bg, brand icon, **3px brand bar on inline-start edge**, `--shadow-premium`.
**Disabled placeholder:** opacity 0.4, no hover, `aria-disabled="true"`.

**Logo:** 32px twin pill shapes (brand green + orange accent), rotated accent bg at 12deg.

