## Layout variants — פירוט מיקומים

### A. Auth layout (`login`, `register`)

```
Card shell (no nav strip)
└── Centered auth panel (flex center, both axes)
    └── Auth card max-width 24rem
```

- Card shell **ללא** icon nav, **ללא** sidebars
- Auth card: white, `--shadow-card`, `--radius-2xl`, padding `--space-8`
- שדות: light inputs; primary button brand green
- Guest shell: אותו card frame על `--app-bg`

### B. Standard layout (`/groups`, `/profile`, `/invitations`, forms)

```
Card shell
├── Icon nav 70px
└── Main panel (flex-1, --main-bg, overflow-y auto)
    └── Page content (padding --space-6)
```

- **אין** chat list sidebar, **אין** files strip
- Page header: title + actions בשורה עליונה
- `group-list`: grid/list של group-cards בתוך main panel
- Back navigation: chevron `arrow_back` / `chevron_left` ב-header (לא sidebar)

### C. Chat workspace (`/groups/:id`)

```
Card shell
├── Icon nav 70px
├── Chat list sidebar 340px
├── Main chat panel flex-1
└── Files strip 85px
```

**זה ה-layout היחיד** עם chat list sidebar + files strip.

#### Chat list sidebar (`.chat-list-sidebar`)

**מיקום:** מיד אחרי icon nav, `inline-start`.

| Zone | מיקום | תוכן |
|------|-------|------|
| Mobile header | top, md:hidden | brand dot + title + "Files Panel" toggle |
| Profile header | top, p-6 | back btn, "Chat" title, settings btn |
| User portrait | center | 80px avatar, status dot, name, status pill dropdown |
| Search | px-6 | pill input, icon inline-start |
| Section label | px-6 | "Last chats" + new chat (+) + menu (⋮) |
| Chat items | flex-1 scroll | group/conversation rows |

**Profile header row (top mini):** `[back] — "Chat" — [settings]`, justify space-between.

**Status pill:** `--brand-light` bg, brand text, radius full, chevron down; dropdown centered below.

**Chat list item:**

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [avatar 44px]  Name (bold)      time    │
│                subtitle         ●unread │
└────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Padding 14px, radius `--radius-lg`
- Active: `#f8fafc` bg + **3px brand border on inline-start** + `--shadow-sm`
- Typing subtitle: brand color, italic
- Unread: 8px brand dot inline-end

**Mobile (`<768px`):** chat list ↔ main toggle; selecting chat hides list; back button in chat header.

#### Main chat panel (`.chat-main`)

**מיקום:** בין chat list ל-files strip, `flex: 1`, `--main-bg`.

**Header (sticky top):**
```
[back mobile] Title + status ping    [search] [files toggle chevron]
```
- Frosted `--frosted-bg` + backdrop-blur
- Title bold; status: green ping dot + muted "N members active"
- **אין** Messages/Participants tabs (לא במ scope)

**Message area:** flex-1, scroll, padding `--space-6`, gap 24px between groups.

**Footer composer (sticky bottom):**
- Frosted footer
- Pill bar: `--main-bg`, `--shadow-inner`, max-width ~896px centered
- `[textarea flex-1] [emoji] [attach] [send circle brand]`

#### Files strip (`.files-sidebar`)

**מיקום:** `inline-end`, width `var(--files-strip-width)` — 85px.

**מבנה אנכי (top → bottom):**

```
┌──────────┐
│ chevron  │  ← toggle collapse
├──────────┤
│ avatar   │  ← stacked -space-y-2, +N badge
│  stack   │
├──────────┤
│ "Files"  │  ← label 11px uppercase tracking-wider
├──────────┤
│ file     │  ← vertical icon pills, gap 16px
│ type     │
│ buttons  │
├──────────┤
│ spacer   │
└──────────┘
```

| File type | mat-icon | Background | Icon color |
|-----------|----------|------------|------------|
| Document | `description` | `#eff6ff` (blue-50) | `#3b82f6` |
| Image | `image` | `#fffbeb` (amber-50) | `#f59e0b` |
| Video | `movie` | `#ecfeff` (cyan-50) | `#06b6d4` |
| Spreadsheet | `pie_chart` | `#fff1f2` (rose-50) | `#f43f5e` |
| Link | `link` | `#ecfdf5` (emerald-50) | `#10b981` |

- Button: 40×40px, `--radius-md`; hover: darken bg one step
- Toggle: chevron points **inline-end** when open, collapses strip on desktop
- Mobile: overlay drawer from inline-end, `z-40`, shadow-2xl, ~70vh height

### D. Agent layout (`agent-chat`)

- **אותו shell** כמו Standard: icon nav + main panel
- Bubbles + composer: **זהים ל-chat-main** (ראה Message bubbles)
- Header: "AI Assistant" + subtitle muted
- RTL: hints בעברית, `dir="auto"` על bubble text
- Pending: typing dots brand color

