## RTL — מבנה ומיקומים

| Element | LTR | RTL |
|---------|-----|-----|
| Icon nav | inline-start (left) | inline-start (right) |
| Chat list sidebar | after nav | after nav (right side) |
| Files strip | inline-end (right) | inline-end (left) |
| Active nav/chat indicator bar | inline-start edge | inline-start edge (right) |
| Own message bubble | `margin-inline-start: auto` | same — aligns inline-end |
| Back chevron | `chevron_left` | `chevron_right` (or mirror via `[dir=rtl]`) |
| Search icon | padding-inline-start | same logical property |
| Scrollbar | default | default (thin, no flip needed) |

- Set `dir="rtl"` on `html` or user preference; shell uses **flex row** with logical order — אל תשתמש ב-`flex-direction: row-reverse` ידני
- Message timestamps: `"You, HH:mm"` / `"Name, HH:mm"` — שמור פסיק ופורמט
- Agent chat + user messages: `unicode-bidi: plaintext` / `dir="auto"` on content

