## Message bubbles

**Own (`--own`):**
- Container: `margin-inline-start: auto`, max-width 80%, flex column align inline-end
- Meta above bubble: 10px muted semibold — `"You, HH:mm"`
- Bubble: `--bubble-self`, padding 12px 20px, radius 20px with **top-inline-end corner 4px** (LTR: top-right)
- Border: `rgba(148,163,184,0.5)`

**Others:**
- Row: avatar 36px inline-start + column
- Meta above: `"Sender, HH:mm"`
- Bubble: white, top-inline-start corner 4px, border `--border-light`

**Spacing:** 24px between message groups. No full-width card on `.message-item`.

**Typing indicator:** avatar 32px + white pill, author semibold, 3 brand dots bounce (stagger 0.1s).

