## Responsive breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Shell | Nav strip | Chat list | Files strip |
|------------|-------|-----------|-----------|-------------|
| `<768px` | full viewport, no radius | hidden | toggle with main | overlay drawer |
| `768–1023px` | 90vh, radius 32px | hidden | visible in chat layout | hidden |
